  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_shroomlight/quest/desc": "给魔理沙带回菌光体和下界真菌。",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_shroomlight/option/start": "我能帮你弄那个。",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_shroomlight/option/start/reject": "晚点再说吧。",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_shroomlight/option/start/reject/bye": "再见！",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_shroomlight/option/start/accept": "我去办！",
