  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_shroomlight/option/follow_up/end": "我正在办！",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_shroomlight/option/follow_up/end/bye": "再见！",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_shroomlight/option/complete": "我拿到好东西了！",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_shroomlight/option/complete/handover": "给你！",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_shroomlight/option/complete/handover/bye": "再见！",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_shroomlight/dialog/marisa/daily_shroomlight/start/dialog_1": "喂！我还要更多下界的发光蘑菇和菌光体。你现在可是我的私人下界侦察员了，ZE！跑一趟，很快就能带回来。",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_shroomlight/dialog/marisa/daily_shroomlight/start/accept/dialog_1": "这才是我的侦察员！把发光的好东西给我带回来！",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_shroomlight/dialog/marisa/daily_shroomlight/start/reject/dialog_1": "什么？下界又没那么可怕！小心点熔岩就行了！",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_shroomlight/dialog/marisa/daily_shroomlight/follow_up/dialog_1": "还在下界吗？可别最后自己也变成蘑菇了！",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_shroomlight/dialog/marisa/daily_shroomlight/follow_up/end/dialog_1": "注意安全！",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_shroomlight/dialog/marisa/daily_shroomlight/complete/dialog_1": "哦，弄到了？让我看看！",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_shroomlight/dialog/marisa/daily_shroomlight/complete/handover/dialog_1": "太完美了！谢啦，侦察员！",
