  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_brewing/option/complete/handover/bye": "再见！",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_brewing/dialog/marisa/daily_brewing/start/dialog_1": "这边正忙着酿一大锅呢，结果基础材料刚好没了！赶紧去下界给我弄点烈焰棒和下界疣回来，行不？乖！",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_brewing/dialog/marisa/daily_brewing/start/accept/dialog_1": "这才是我需要的搭档！把酿造材料给我带回来！",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_brewing/dialog/marisa/daily_brewing/start/reject/dialog_1": "哎，别丢下我不管啊！酿造可不会自己酿！",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_brewing/dialog/marisa/daily_brewing/follow_up/dialog_1": "还在收集吗？酿造还等着你呢！",
  "gensokyolegacy/marisa/daily_brewing/dialog/marisa/daily_brewing/follow_up/end/dialog_1": "快去快回，酿造还等着呢！",
